llows a similar logic with the `x` component. I am building a simulation interface for testing these states on desktop. I can show a 3D mock phone, with controls!\n\n\n**Designing Code Structure**\n\nI am now structuring the code for this gravity-based timer. I\'m focusing on key components: `/src/types.ts` for essential interfaces, `/src/utils/audio.ts` for audio feedback, `/src/components/PhoneSimulator.tsx` for the interactive 3D mock phone, `/src/components/GravityTimer.tsx` for the timer logic, `/src/components/HistoryStats.tsx` for user history, and `/src/components/SettingsPanel.tsx` for customization. The 3D phone is a huge win!\n\n\n"
