er-friendliness by making the switch intuitive. I am also checking the device state classification.\n\n\n**Deriving Real-Time Directions**\n\nI\'ve made a crucial breakthrough. I\'ve realized I can derive `activeFaceState` and `activeDirection` in real-time within `App.tsx` directly from `sensorData`. I\'m now implementing the logic where null `direction` results in maintaining the *previously selected* direction, essential for handling flat phone orientations. This ensures the user\'s selected mode persists during flat positions, a design that mirrors physical timers!\n\n\n"
